      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-301151",
      ":question/problem": "A school has $72$ teachers. A random sample of $24$ teachers was taken, and among those surveyed, $9$ of them said they plan to attend an upcoming professional development workshop.\n\nBased on the sample data, which of the following is the best estimate of the total number of teachers at the school who plan to attend the workshop?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
