      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-301177",
      ":question/problem": "A state has $48,600$ registered nurses. A random sample of $300$ nurses was taken, and among those surveyed, $120$ said they plan to participate in a new statewide training program.\n\nBased on the sample data, which of the following is the best estimate of the total number of nurses in the state who plan to participate in the program?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
